<title>FINLAND: KONECRANES BUYS CANADIAN CRANE SERVICES CO.</title>
<headline>KONECRANES BUYS CANADIAN CRANE SERVICES CO.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish cranemaker KCI Konecranes International Oy said in a statement on Monday it had bought Canadian crane maintenance firm All Crane Parts &amp; Service Ltd for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>The Edmonton based company's net sales are about one million Canadian dollars and it employs 11 people, Konecranes said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 242</p>
</text>
